  "title": "Banana Nut Coconut Cake",
  "description": "Bananas, coconut, and pecans give this moist buttermilk cake a unique flavor. Topped with a Banana Nut Frosting, this cake is best if made a day before serving.",
  "authors": [
    "ETHELMERTZ"
  ],
